      "content": "7. Collective Responsibility"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 75(3) specifies collective responsibility to the Lok Sabha specifically, not Parliament as a whole.",
        "Article 78 explicitly details the Prime Minister's constitutional duties to communicate all administrative decisions to the President.",
        "The term 'Cabinet' was inserted into Article 352 of the Constitution via the 44th Constitutional Amendment Act, 1978."
      ],
      "id": "nvgncjw"
